  "description": "Himiway C1 Kids Electric Bike: Where Safety Meets Adventure\n\n45–50 Mile Range | Adjustable Speed Modes\n\nLooking for a kids eBike that grows with your child? Meet the Himiway C1 – designed with parents’ peace of mind and kids’ freedom in mind.\n\nWhy Parents Love the C1:\n\n✅ 3 Smart Speed Modes: Start with 7 mph (training wheels mode), then unlock 13 mph or 15 mph as skills grow.\n✅ Adjustable Seat & Handlebars: Fits riders aged 4-12 (3'3\" ~ 4'9\") – no more yearly bike upgrades!\n✅ Ultra-Safe Brakes: Dual disc brakes + motor cutoff stop faster than a popsicle melts in July.\n\nBuilt for Kid-Tough Fun:\n\nLightweight Frame: 33 lbs (lighter than most kids eBikes) – easy to handle, even on hills.\n\nPuncture-Proof Tires: 16” fat tires laugh at sidewalk cracks and gravel paths.\n\nParental Remote Control: Lost your voice? Use the remote to limit speed or kill the motor instantly.",
